# In-flight subgame shard output. Appended to continuously while a
# generation run goes, so tracking it mid-run races every commit against
# the writers. The run is deterministic given its seed, so losing it
# costs time and not information; the completed family file is committed
# with `git add -f` once every shard has written its '# admission'
# footer.
rl/artifacts/subgame/gen_s*_sh*.tsv
# In-flight gate output, same reason as the shard files above: appended
# to while gate 1 and gate 3 run, so tracking it mid-run races every
# commit. Force-added once GATES|DONE is in gates.log.
rl/artifacts/subgame/gate1_*.tsv
rl/artifacts/subgame/gate3_*.tsv
rl/artifacts/subgame/gate1retry_*.tsv
